{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/formatted(date:time:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"formatted"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"date"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Date","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"FormatStyle","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV0A20InternationalizationE11FormatStyleV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle\/DateStyle","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DateStyle","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV0A20InternationalizationE11FormatStyleV0cF0V"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"time"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Date","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"FormatStyle","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV0A20InternationalizationE11FormatStyleV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle\/TimeStyle","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TimeStyle","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV0A20InternationalizationE11FormatStyleV04TimeF0V"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The style for describing the date part.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"date"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The style for describing the time part."}]}],"name":"time"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A string, formatted according to the specified date and time styles."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When displaying a date to a user, use the convenient "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"formatted(date:time:)"},{"type":"text","text":" instance method to customize the string representation of the date. Set the date and time styles of the date format style separately, according to your particular needs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, to create a string with a full date and no time representation, set the date style to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"complete"},{"type":"text","text":" and the time style to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"omitted"},{"type":"text","text":". Conversely, to create a string representing only the time, set the date style to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"omitted"},{"type":"text","text":" and the time style to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"complete"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let birthday = Date()","","birthday.formatted(date: .complete, time: .omitted) \/\/ Sunday, January 17, 2021","birthday.formatted(date: .omitted, time: .complete) \/\/ 4:03:12 PM CST"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can create string representations of a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Date"},{"type":"text","text":" instance with several levels of brevity using a variety of preset date and time styles. This example shows date styles of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"long"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"abbreviated"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"numeric"},{"type":"text","text":", and time styles of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shortened"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"standard"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"complete"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let birthday = Date()","","birthday.formatted(date: .long, time: .shortened) \/\/ January 17, 2021, 4:03 PM","birthday.formatted(date: .abbreviated, time: .standard) \/\/ Jan 17, 2021, 4:03:12 PM","birthday.formatted(date: .numeric, time: .complete) \/\/ 1\/17\/2021, 4:03:12 PM CST","","birthday.formatted() \/\/ Jan 17, 2021, 4:03 PM"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default date style is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"abbreviated"},{"type":"text","text":" and the default time style is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shortened"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For the default date formatting, use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"formatted()"},{"type":"text","text":" method. To customize the formatted measurement string, use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"formatted(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method and include a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Date.FormatStyle"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For more information about formatting dates, see "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle",